 Oil (1 Liter) | Part No.: 20209-0010-99G ROWE Hightec Advance Fully Synthetic SAE 10W-50 is a high-performance engine oil designed specifically for motorcycles. Made with HC synthetic base oils combined with carefully selected additives, it delivers outstanding engine protection, smooth operation, and excellent thermal stability. Key Features: Fully synthetic formulation for maximum engine protection SAE viscosity grade 10W-50 ensures reliable performance in a wide temperature range Specially designed for modern motorcycle engines Enhanced wear resistance and oxidation stability Suitable for engines requiring the JASO MA2 specification for wet clutch compatibility Specifications & Approvals: Meets API SN/SM/SL/SJ/SH/SG standards Complies with JASO MA2 (motorcycle wet clutch performance) This oil supports your motorcycle’s performance and longevity by ensuring optimal lubrication under demanding riding conditions.\",\"priceRange\":{\"minVariantPrice\":{\"amount\":\"998.0\",\"currencyCode\":\"INR\"}},\"images\":[{\"url\":\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1012/0619/6541/files/ROWE-Fully-Synthetic-Motorbike-10w50-Oil.png?v=1787058036\",\"altText\":\"ROWE Hightec Advance Fully Synthetic SAE 10W-50 Motorcycle Oil (1 Lit) - 20209-0010-99G\"}],\"variants\":[{\"id\":\"gid://shopify/ProductVariant/52880855531837\",\"title\":\"Default Title\",\"price\":{\"amount\":\"998.0\",\"currencyCode\":\"INR\"},\"compareAtPrice\":null,\"availableForSale\":true,\"quantityAvailable\":null}],\"brand\":\"ROWE\",\"category\":\"Accessories\",\"compatibility\":[\"ROWE Motorcycle Oil\"],\"specifications\":[{\"name\":\"Brand\",\"value\":\"ROWE\"},{\"name\":\"Category\",\"value\":\"Accessories\"}],\"reviews\":[{\"id\":\"rev-default-1\",\"author\":\"Verified Rider\",\"rating\":5,\"date\":\"2026-06-01\",\"title\":\"Genuine product\",\"comment\":\"Shipped fast, original packing. Performance is exactly as advertised.\"}],\"rating\":4.7,\"hp_gain\":\"$undefined\",\"weight_saved\":\"$undefined\",\"saf