link\",\"3\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href\":\"https://iranimotohub.in/collections/lubricants\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"4\",{\"property\":\"og:title\",\"content\":\"Lubricants | Premium Performance | Irani MotoHub\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"5\",{\"property\":\"og:description\",\"content\":\"Browse our exclusive collection of Lubricants on Irani MotoHub.\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"6\",{\"property\":\"og:image\",\"content\":\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1012/0619/6541/collections/Putoline_Tech_Chain_-_500ml.png?v=1787080114\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"7\",{\"property\":\"og:image:alt\",\"content\":\"Lubricants\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"8\",{\"name\":\"twitter:card\",\"content\":\"summary_large_image\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"9\",{\"name\":\"twitter:title\",\"content\":\"Irani MotoHub | Premium Motorcycle Performance Parts\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"10\",{\"name\":\"twitter:description\",\"content\":\"Premium Motorcycle accessories and performance upgrades\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"11\",{\"name\":\"twitter:image\",\"content\":\"https://iranimotohub.in/hero-bg.png\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"12\",{\"rel\":\"shortcut icon\",\"href\":\"/imhlogo.png\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"13\",{\"rel\":\"icon\",\"href\":\"/favicon.ico?favicon.1-ypg-tqme8hc.ico\",\"sizes\":\"1024x1024\",\"type\":\"image/x-icon\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"14\",{\"rel\":\"icon\",\"href\":\"/imhlogo.png\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"15\",{\"rel\":\"apple-touch-icon\",\"href\":\"/imhlogo.png\"}],[\"$\",\"$L2c\",\"16\",{}]]\n2d:I[12371,[\"/_next/static/chunks/2wh3bu9ub4p8d.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/2bmv3ihep17gq.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/3cichi1mg1ftc.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/3whgfyvaz15fw.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0q6ibp_bkaa1-.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/3j-4ruzks89pv.js\"],\"default\"]\n2e:T4d4,ROWE Hightec Advance Fully Synthetic SAE 10W-40 Motorcycle Oil (1 Liter) | Part No.: 20049-0010-99G ROWE Hightec Advance Fully Synthetic SAE 10W-40 is a high-performance motorcycle engine oil formulated using advanced hydrocracked synthetic base oils and carefully selected additives. This fully synthetic oil provides outstanding protection and performance across a wide range of operating conditions. Key Features & Benefits: Fully synthetic HC base oils for superior engine protection High thermal and oxidative stability for long oil life Excellent wear protection and cleanliness Smooth engine operation with reduced friction Suitable for motorcycles with wet clutches requiring the JASO MA2 specification SAE 10W-40 viscosity grade for versatile all-season use Specifications & Approvals: API: SN / SM / SL / SJ / SH / SG JASO: MA2 (wet clutch compatible) Applications: Designed for high-performance motorcycles requiring synthetic 10W-40 oil Suitable for 4-stroke engines, including those with wet clutch systems Ideal for sport bikes, touring motorcycles, and scooters ROWE Hightec Advance Fully Synthetic SAE 10W-40 ensures optimal engine performance, protection, and smooth shifting for motorcycles under demanding conditions.2f:Tb91,66BHP Chain Care Series 66BHP Fully Synthetic Chain Lube – 500 ml Smooth power transfer | Monsoon + dust protection | Longer chain & sprocket life FULLY SYNTHETIC Deep penetration for effective lubrication and protection. WATER-RESISTANT Designed to resist rain and wash-off, making it ideal for Indian monsoon conditions. QUIET + SMOOTH Reduces friction and chain noise for smoother riding. 500 ML VALUE PACK More usage and better value for regular riders, workshops and touring. MADE FOR INDIAN RIDING Built to handle monsoon rain, dust, humidity and daily stop-and-go riding while keeping your drivetrain protected. BEST FOR Daily riders • Touring • Workshops • Long-term maintenance WHAT YOU FEEL Smoother throttle response Less chain slap • Better roll-on • Cleaner running PRODUCT OVERVIEW Engineered for riders who demand performance and durability, the 66BHP Fully Synthetic Chain Lube – 500 ml delivers effective lubrication, protection and smooth power transfer for all types of motorcycles. Its fully synthetic formula penetrates deep into chain links and rollers, forming a protective layer that helps resist water wash-off, reduce friction and protect against rust and corrosion. KEY BENEFITS Fully Synthetic Formula Provides consistent lubrication under load and helps reduce chain wear and elongation over time. Water-Resistant Protection Designed to stay effective in rain, humidity and wet-road conditions, helping reduce wash-off during monsoons. Reduces Noise & Friction Promotes smoother chain movement for better throttle response and reduced chain slap. Anti-Rust & Anti-Corrosion Helps protect metal surfaces and extend chain and sprocket life, especially in coastal and rainy regions. Long-Lasting Performance Fewer reapplications and more riding time. Ideal for regular commuters and touring riders. 500 ml Value Pack Ideal for frequent use, workshops, touring groups and long-term chain maintenance. CLEANER DRIVETRAIN. SMOOTHER RIDE. A properly lubricated chain helps reduce wear, minimize noise and improve power transfer, making your motorcycle feel smoother and more responsive. IDEAL FOR INDIAN CONDITIONS Suitable for city traffic, highways, touring, monsoon riding and dusty roads. Built for real-world Indian riding conditions. HOW TO USE CLEAN Clean the chain first for maximum lubrication and better bonding. APPLY Spray evenly on the inside of the chain while rotating the wheel slowly. SET Allow the lubricant to settle for a short time before riding so it can penetrate and form a protective layer. TIP: Avoid over-spraying. A thin, even coat provides better protection and keeps the chain cleaner. RIDE MORE. MAINTAIN LESS. Whether you're maintaining your daily ride or preparing for a long tour, 66BHP Fully Synthetic Chain Lube – 500 ml helps keep your drivetrain cleaner, quieter and protected for longer. For optimal chain life, clean and lubricate the chain regularly based on your riding conditions.30:Te94,.bhp-desc, .bhp-desc * { box-sizing: border-box; } /* Mobile: full width (removes empty left/right space) */ @media (max-width: 749px){ .bhp-desc{ width:100vw !important; max-width:100vw !important; margin-left:calc(50% - 50vw) !important; margin-right:calc(50% - 50vw) !important; padding-left:12px !important; padding-right:12px !important; overflow:hidden !important; } .bhp-hero{ padding:16px !important; } .bhp-sec{ padding:14px !important; } .bhp-title{ font-size:22px !important; } .bhp-sub{ font-size:13px !important; } .bhp-grid{ grid-template-columns:1fr !important; } .bhp-chip{ padding:9px 10px !important; } .bhp-kicker{ font-size:11px !important; } .bhp-cta{ padding:14px !important; } } 66BHP Workshop Care Series 66BHP Brake & Parts Cleaner – 500 ml (Pro-Power Formula) Cuts oil + grease fast | Evaporates clean | Brakes, parts & workshop use Residue-Free No oily film Fast Evaporation Less downtime Deep Cleaning Oil, dust, debris 500 ml Pack Workshop value size Street • Touring • Track Keeps braking components clean and contamination-free for consistent performance—perfect for service days and pre-ride prep. Best for: Brake service • Degreasing parts • Workshop cleanup • DIY maintenance Cleaner parts = better work Spray. Dissolve. Evaporate. No residue • Fast drying • Easy application The 66BHP Brake & Parts Cleaner (500 ml) is a high-performance cleaning solution designed for motorcycles and automotive braking systems. Its advanced Pro-Power Formula penetrates deep into oil residue, grease buildup, brake dust, and debris—breaking them down quickly and evaporating fast without leaving residue. Ideal for street, touring, and track use, it helps keep critical components clean and contamination-free for consistent braking feel. What It Cleans Brake discs & rotors Removes brake dust, road grime, and oil residue. Brake calipers Helps clear dust and contamination from key areas. Brake pads (surface cleaning only) For light surface contaminants (avoid soaking). Engine & metal components Degreases oily areas during maintenance. Chains, sprockets & mechanical parts Cuts through grime before re-lubing (reapply lube after). Workshop tools & assemblies Quick cleanup for a cleaner workspace. Pro Tip (for best results) Use as a pre-clean step before fitting new pads/parts or before applying fresh chain lube—clean surfaces help performance products work better. Why Choose 66BHP Brake Cleaner? ✅ Residue-Free Finish No oily film—keeps braking surfaces clean and uncompromised. ✅ Fast Evaporation Reduces downtime during service—spray, dissolve, and let it dry quickly. ✅ Track-Ready Cleaning Helps keep braking sharp by reducing contamination on critical parts. ✅ Workshop & DIY Friendly Easy spray-on application for quick, professional-grade results. ✅ 500 ml Pack (Better Value) Ideal for regular riders, garages, and workshops—more cleanings per can. ✅ Made in India German technology inspired formulation approach for strong cleaning performance. How to Use 1) Shake well Shake the can before use for consistent spray performance. 2) Spray directly Spray onto the surface from a safe distance for even coverage. 3) Dissolve & dry Allow it to dissolve oil and debris, then let it air-dry (wipe if required). ⚠️ Safety Note Use in a well-ventilated area. Avoid spraying on painted or plastic surfaces. Keep away from heat/flames and follow standard workshop safety practices. Clean parts. Confident brakes. Prep your bike the right way with 66BHP Brake & Parts Cleaner (500 ml)—fast cleaning, residue-free finish, and workshop-grade results. *Brake pads: surface cleaning only. Avoid prolonged soaking. Always verify component compatibility before use.31:Td38,Putoline RS1 Wax Polish Spray – 500ml is a premium motorcycle cleaner and polish enriched with carnauba wax. It cleans treated surfaces while creating a smooth protective layer with a deep, long-lasting shine. The easy-to-use aerosol formula is suitable for regular motorcycle detailing as well as final polishing after a complete wash. This motorcycle wax polish spray can be used on compatible painted, aluminium, carbon, titanium and coated surfaces. It is suitable for motorcycles, helmets, scooters, quads, bicycles, karts, snowmobiles and jet skis, making it a versatile care product for road and off-road vehicles. The 500ml spray bottle allows quick and even application across body panels, fuel tanks, fairings and helmets. It is ideal for riders who want to improve surface gloss while adding a protective finish that helps keep the vehicle cleaner for longer. Key Features Cleaner and wax polish in one product Enriched with premium carnauba wax Produces a deep and long-lasting shine Creates a protective layer on treated surfaces Suitable for painted and coated motorcycle parts Can be used on aluminium, carbon and titanium Suitable for motorcycles and helmets Easy spray-on and buff-off application Suitable for road and off-road vehicles Convenient 500ml aerosol can Benefits Restores shine to dull motorcycle surfaces Helps maintain a clean and polished appearance Adds a protective layer over treated components Makes routine motorcycle detailing easier Helps reduce the adhesion of light dirt and moisture Suitable for use on several premium materials Provides fast and even application Ideal for riders, detailers and professional workshops Applications Putoline RS1 Wax Polish Spray can be used on compatible: Painted motorcycle body panels Fuel tanks and fairings Aluminium motorcycle parts Carbon-fibre components Titanium components Painted and coated helmets Road and off-road motorcycles Scooters and quads Bicycles and karts Snowmobiles and jet skis Do not apply the product to brake discs, brake pads, tyres, seats, grips, foot controls or other surfaces where reduced friction may create a safety risk. Technical Specifications Brand: Putoline Product Name: RS1 Wax Polish Spray Product Type: Cleaner and protective wax polish Pack Size: 500ml Packaging: Aerosol spray Wax Type: Carnauba wax Primary Function: Cleaning, polishing and surface protection Suitable Materials: Painted surfaces, aluminium, carbon and titanium Suitable Vehicles: Motorcycles, scooters, quads, bicycles, karts, snowmobiles and jet skis SKU: 70315 Application Method: Spray and buff with a clean cloth Putoline officially describes RS1 as a carnauba-wax cleaner that creates a protective layer and deep shine on painted surfaces. Baycity Power Parts also lists it for compatible metal, carbon, composite and helmet surfaces. Why Choose Putoline? Putoline specialises in motorcycle lubricants, cleaning products and technical maintenance solutions designed specifically for motorcycles and powersport vehicles. Its care range includes dedicated products for cleaning, polishing and protecting different motorcycle materials. RS1 Wax Polish Spray offers cleaning, shine enhancement and surface protection in one convenient aerosol. Its carnauba-wax formulation makes it a practical choice for riders who want a polished finish without using separate cleaning and waxing products.32:Td2f,Putoline Chain & Engine Degreaser – 500ml is a fast-acting motorcycle cleaning spray developed to remove oil, grease and stubborn grime from drivetrain and engine components. Its powerful formula works quickly on contaminated areas, helping simplify routine cleaning before inspection, servicing or chain lubrication. This motorcycle chain and engine degreaser can be used on chains, sprockets, gears, engine exteriors, frames and other dirty motorcycle parts. It is compatible with chrome, painted surfaces, rubber and plastic when applied according to the product instructions. The water-soluble formula rinses away easily and leaves no unwanted residue behind. Its convenient 500ml aerosol format makes it suitable for home garages, motorcycle detailers and professional workshops. Key Features Fast-acting motorcycle degreasing formula Removes oil, grease and stubborn grime Suitable for chains, gears and sprockets Cleans motorcycle engine exteriors and frames Compatible with chrome and painted surfaces Suitable for compatible rubber and plastic parts Water-soluble formula for easy rinsing Leaves no unwanted cleaning residue Reaches narrow and difficult-to-clean areas Suitable for road and off-road motorcycles Convenient 500ml aerosol application Product SKU 70049 Benefits Helps remove heavy grease from motorcycle chains Prepares chains for fresh lubricant application Makes engine and drivetrain cleaning easier Helps reveal wear, leaks and damaged components Reduces oily buildup around sprockets and frames Rinses away without leaving a greasy coating Suitable for cleaning several motorcycle materials Reduces the need for aggressive manual scrubbing Helps maintain a cleaner motorcycle appearance Suitable for riders and professional workshops Applications Putoline Chain & Engine Degreaser can be used on compatible: Motorcycle drive chains Front and rear sprockets Gears and drivetrain components Motorcycle engine exteriors Frames and swingarms Chrome motorcycle components Painted motorcycle surfaces Compatible rubber components Plastic body and mechanical parts Road, racing and off-road motorcycles Avoid applying the degreaser to hot components. Keep it away from brake discs, brake pads, tyres and other friction surfaces, and confirm compatibility before using it on custom finishes or delicate materials. Technical Specifications Brand: Putoline Product Name: Chain & Engine Degreaser Product Type: Motorcycle chain and engine cleaner Pack Size: 500ml Packaging Type: Aerosol spray SKU: 70049 Formula: Fast-acting, water-soluble degreaser Primary Cleaning Targets: Oil, grease and grime Suitable Components: Chains, gears, engines and frames Compatible Surfaces: Chrome, paint, rubber and plastic Residue: Leaves no residue when correctly rinsed Primary Application: Motorcycle cleaning and maintenance Why Choose Putoline? Putoline specialises in premium lubricants and maintenance products developed exclusively for powered two-wheelers. Its motorcycle-care range includes dedicated products for drivetrain cleaning, lubrication, engine maintenance and surface protection. Chain & Engine Degreaser combines strong cleaning action with broad compatibility across common motorcycle surfaces. Its water-soluble, residue-free formulation makes it a practical choice before chain lubrication, mechanical inspection or detailed motorcycle cleaning.33:Tecc,Putoline Tech Chain – 500ml is a premium motorcycle chain lubricant formulated with ceramic wax, PTFE and advanced protective additives. It creates a durable, low-friction coating that helps reduce chain and sprocket wear while supporting smooth, quiet and efficient drivetrain operation. Its strong adhesive properties allow the lubricant to remain on the chain during high-speed and demanding riding, helping reduce fling onto wheels and surrounding motorcycle components. The wax-based finish also attracts less dust and dirt than heavily sticky chain lubricants, making regular chain maintenance cleaner and easier. Putoline Tech Chain is suitable for compatible sealed O-ring chains, standard motorcycle chains and motocross chains. It is designed for road, racing and off-road motorcycles used by everyday riders, professional workshops and competition teams. Putoline develops its lubricants specifically for powered two-wheelers, while the product is sold in India under SKU 70367. Key Features Premium ceramic-wax motorcycle chain lubricant Formulated with PTFE and advanced additives Creates a durable, low-friction protective layer Suitable for compatible O-ring motorcycle chains Suitable for standard and motocross chains Strong adhesion helps minimise lubricant fling Helps reduce chain and sprocket wear Attracts less dirt than heavily sticky lubricants Supports smooth and quiet chain operation Suitable for road, racing and off-road motorcycles Easy and controlled aerosol application Convenient 500ml spray can Benefits Helps extend motorcycle chain and sprocket life Reduces friction between links, rollers and sprocket teeth Supports smoother and quieter drivetrain performance Helps protect the chain against moisture and corrosion Minimises lubricant splatter around the rear wheel Reduces excessive dust and grime accumulation Maintains dependable lubrication during demanding rides Makes routine chain inspection and cleaning easier Supports efficient transfer of engine power Suitable for home maintenance and professional workshops Applications Putoline Tech Chain can be used on compatible: O-ring motorcycle chains Standard motorcycle drive chains Motocross and MX chains Road motorcycles Sports bikes and superbikes Touring motorcycles Adventure motorcycles Racing and track motorcycles Motocross and enduro motorcycles Trail and off-road motorcycles Always follow the chain manufacturer’s care instructions. Keep the lubricant away from tyres, brake discs, brake pads and other surfaces that depend on friction. Technical Specifications Brand: Putoline Product Name: Tech Chain Product Type: Motorcycle chain lubricant Lubricant Technology: Ceramic-wax formulation Additives: PTFE and protective additives Pack Size: 500ml Packaging Type: Aerosol spray SKU: 70367 Chain Compatibility: Compatible sealed and motocross chains Primary Functions: Lubrication, friction reduction and wear protection Finish: Durable wax-based lubricating film Suitable Use: Road, racing and off-road motorcycles Application Method: Spray directly onto a clean, dry chain The current Indian Putoline listings identify Tech Chain Lube under SKU 70367, while Baycity Power Parts includes chain lubricants within its motorcycle-specific Putoline care range. Why Choose Putoline? Putoline specialises in oils, lubricants and maintenance products developed exclusively for powered two-wheelers. Its range includes motorcycle engine oils, fork oils, chain lubricants and cleaning products for road, racing and off-road applications. Tech Chain combines ceramic-wax lubrication, PTFE protection and strong adhesion in one easy-to-use aerosol. It is a practical option for riders who want dependable chain protection with reduced fling and less dirt accumulation around the drivetrain.34:Te2c,Putoline DX11 Chain Spray – 500ml is a high-performance motorcycle chain lubricant developed to provide deep penetration, strong adhesion and dependable protection in changing riding conditions. Its advanced formula reaches tight spaces between chain links and rollers, creating a durable lubricating layer that helps reduce friction and wear. The water-repellent formulation helps protect the chain against moisture, rust and corrosion. Its super-tacky, low-fling properties allow the lubricant to remain on the chain at higher speeds, helping keep the rear wheel and surrounding drivetrain components cleaner. This motorcycle chain spray is suitable for open chains and compatible O-ring, X-ring and Z-ring chains. It can be used on road, touring, racing and off-road motorcycles requiring reliable chain protection against dust, grime, water and demanding operating loads. Key Features High-performance motorcycle chain lubricant Deep-penetrating formulation Strong, super-tacky adhesion Helps minimise lubricant fling at speed Water-repellent protective action Reduces friction between chain components Helps protect against rust and corrosion Suitable for open motorcycle chains Compatible with O-ring, X-ring and Z-ring chains Suitable for road and off-road motorcycles Precision aerosol application Convenient 500ml spray can Benefits Helps extend motorcycle chain and sprocket life Supports smoother and quieter drivetrain operation Reduces friction between links, rollers and sprocket teeth Protects the chain against rain and moisture exposure Helps prevent rust and corrosion during storage or regular use Minimises lubricant splatter around the rear wheel Maintains lubrication during high-speed riding Helps reduce dust and grime-related wear Makes routine chain maintenance more convenient Suitable for riders and professional motorcycle workshops Applications Putoline DX11 Chain Spray can be used on compatible: Open motorcycle chains O-ring motorcycle chains X-ring motorcycle chains Z-ring motorcycle chains Road motorcycles Sports bikes and superbikes Touring and adventure motorcycles Racing and track motorcycles Motocross motorcycles Enduro, trail and off-road motorcycles Always check the chain manufacturer’s maintenance instructions. Keep the lubricant away from brake discs, brake pads, tyres and other surfaces that depend on friction. Technical Specifications Brand: Putoline Product Name: DX11 Chain Spray Product Type: Motorcycle chain lubricant Pack Size: 500ml Packaging Type: Aerosol spray SKU: 70082 Lubricant Properties: Deep-penetrating and super-tacky Water Resistance: Water-repellent formulation Chain Compatibility: Open, O-ring, X-ring and Z-ring chains Primary Functions: Lubrication, wear reduction and corrosion protection Fling Resistance: High Suitable Use: Street, touring, racing and off-road motorcycles Application Method: Spray directly onto a clean and dry chain Baycity Power Parts identifies DX11 Chain Spray under SKU 70082 and lists it as a deep-penetrating, water-repellent and low-fling lubricant for open and sealed motorcycle chains. Why Choose Putoline? Putoline develops motorcycle-specific engine oils, fork fluids, chain lubricants and maintenance products for road, racing and off-road applications. Its products are formulated to handle the loads, temperatures and environmental exposure experienced by motorcycle components. DX11 Chain Spray combines deep penetration with strong adhesion and water-repellent protection. It is a practical choice for riders who need dependable chain lubrication while reducing fling, corrosion and premature drivetrain wear.35:T787,Rowe Engine Oils Hightec Antifreeze Coolant Ready-Mix -25°C (1.5 Liters) | Part No.: 21041-0015-99 Ready-to-Use Coolant for Cast Iron & Aluminum Engines Rowe Hightec Antifreeze Coolant Ready-Mix -25 °C is a premium, ready-to-use coolant designed for modern gasoline engines with cast iron or aluminum blocks. This high-performance antifreeze provides outstanding protection against frost, corrosion, deposits, cavitation, and foam, ensuring long-lasting engine efficiency and reliability. Formulated without nitrites, amines, or phosphates, it meets leading global standards and is ideal for use in vehicles requiring VW TL 774-C (G11) specification. Key Features & Benefits: Ready-to-use formula — no dilution required Freezing protection down to -25 °C Corrosion protection for cast iron and aluminum components Prevents scale, deposits, and foam formation Long-lasting protection and extended coolant life Compatible with other G11-spec antifreeze types Silicate-based formulation — for traditional cooling systems Excellent thermal transfer to support optimal engine cooling Meets or Exceeds Specifications: EU Legislation: SAE J1034 ASTM D3306 / ASTM D4985 OEM / Industry Recommendations: VW TL 774-C (G11) JIS K 2234 Applications: Gasoline engines in cars and light commercial vehicles Suitable for both cast iron and aluminum engines Ideal for cooling systems requiring G11 coolant type Recommended for older European and Asian vehicles using silicate-based coolant Usage Notes: Do not dilute — product is pre-mixed and ready to use Provides full protection to -25 °C For best results, flush old coolant before a complete refill Compatible with similar coolants, but a full system change is recommended to maximize performance Rowe Hightec Antifreeze Coolant Ready-Mix -25 °C offers premium protection and peace of mind, ensuring that your engine stays safe, clean, and cool — even in harsh winter climates.24:[[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https://schema.org\\\",\\\"@type\\\":\\\"BreadcrumbList\\\",\\\"itemListElement\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":1,